{#- Only shown when nobody has answered yet. Until then PostHog is already
    counting the visit cookielessly, so the copy says what accepting actually
    adds rather than asking for a favour. -#}
<div id="cookie-banner" class="hidden bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-kobi z-401 border-t border-black">
  <div class="p-6 max-w-screen-xl mx-auto">
    {%- if page.lang == "de" %}
    <p class="max-w-2xl">
      Wir messen, wie die Seite genutzt wird, um sie zu verbessern. Du wirst
      dabei schon anonym gezählt – ohne Cookies, ohne Daten auf deinem Gerät.
      Mit deinem Einverständnis erkennen wir zusätzlich wiederkehrende Besuche.
      Wir geben nichts an Dritte weiter.
    </p>
    <button
      id="accept-cookie"
      class="text-white text-smc font-bold bg-black px-8 py-2 mt-4 mr-2 inline-block transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-blue-custom"
    >Cookies akzeptieren</button>
    <button
      id="decline-cookie"
      class="text-black text-smc font-bold border-2 border-black px-8 py-2 mt-4 inline-block transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-black hover:text-white"
    >Nein, danke</button>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="max-w-2xl">
      We measure how the site gets used so we can improve it. You're already
      counted anonymously – no cookies, nothing stored on your device.
      Accepting lets us also recognise a returning visit. We don't share any of
      it with anyone.
    </p>
    <button
      id="accept-cookie"
      class="text-white text-smc font-bold bg-black px-8 py-2 mt-4 mr-2 inline-block transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-blue-custom"
    >Accept cookies</button>
    <button
      id="decline-cookie"
      class="text-black text-smc font-bold border-2 border-black px-8 py-2 mt-4 inline-block transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-black hover:text-white"
    >No thanks</button>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</div>
